{"id":"000VNK","title":"Parity Fun 52","author":"galium_odoratum","solvedCount":8,"difficulty":2,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-10-24T12:44:27+00:00","posted":"Heute, 10:00 Uhr","rules":"Another entry to the series, using classic arrows with a small parity twist. Have fun!\n\nNormal Sudoku rules apply.\n\nGerman Whisper: Adjacent digits along a green line must differ by at least 5.\n\nParity Pointing Arrows: Digits along an arrow sum to the digit in the attached circe. Additionally, the circle digit indicates how many visible digits of the same parity (odd or even) must be seen in the direction of the arrow tip. Begin counting with the first cell outside the arrow. For example, a circle containing a 5 requires exactly five visible odd digits in that direction.\n\nPlay on SudokuPad\n\nTry out the others of this series:\n\nParity Fun 40\n\nParity Fun 41\n\nParity Fun 42\n\nParity Fun 43\n\nParity Fun 44\n\nParity Fun 45\n\nParity Fun 46\n\nParity Fun 47\n\nParity Fun 48\n\nParity Fun 49\n\nParity Fun 50\n\nParity Fun 51","solutionCode":"Row 6","tags":["Sudoku","Pfeile","Parität (Thema)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/o7bpng5z02","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/o7bpng5z02","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines","arrows","overlays"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-24T12:44:27+00:00"}